//SwiftPurse\frontend\user\settings.html
-in the navbar of this page at the profile image section when clicked the sub nav profile image there should be populated with dynamic content 
-all user dynamic content are displayed in their indicated field/ui 
-all form fields and their button are work as expected when any validation for  any form fields and submitted successfully it displays a message and it redirects back to same page
-for the reset pin form when it is filled and passed validation it is resetted when the Reset PIN button is clicked a dynamic link to reset the pin is sent to the user email using the forgotten passwird template with write up below

Hi there,

 


We received a request to reset your PIN. If you initiated this request, please click the link below to proceed:


Reset Your PIN

For security purposes, this link will expire in 5 minutes and can only be used once. If you did not request a PIN reset, please disregard this email or contact our support team immediately.

Best Regards,

The SwiftPurse Bank Team

2026 SwiftPurse Bank . All rights reserved.

UK banking services offered by SwiftPurse Bank (RC796975) with registered address at Head office: 21 Lombard St, city of london,London Ec3v 9AH , UK. Clients' money is safeguarded with reputable UK and EU banks. Financial Services Compensation Scheme (FSCS) does not apply.
-when the unique reset link is clicked it redirects to resetpin.html page


